{
  "body_human_readable": "In 2024, Tesla sold approximately 1.79 million electric vehicles worldwide. This figure represents a slight decrease of 1.07% compared to the previous year.\n\nThe company's production for the same year was slightly lower than its deliveries, with approximately 1.773 million vehicles produced. The fourth quarter of 2024 was a record-breaking period for Tesla, with over 495,000 vehicles delivered.\n\nIn terms of regional sales, Tesla saw significant numbers in China, with over 657,000 units sold, an 8.8% increase from the previous year. Conversely, sales in Europe experienced a notable decline. In Hong Kong, the Tesla Model 3 and Model Y were the top-selling vehicles in 2024.",
